{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/27/4636896/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、なんか夕方あたりから舌の先っちょすっごい痛いんだけどこれもしかしてあれかもしかして。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親の言うこと聞いてないと出来るって噂の口内炎か？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......確かに今朝脱いだパジャマ片付け忘れてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やべ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとドライヤーのコンセントも刺しっぱなしだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっべ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こぉりゃぁ口内炎も出来る訳だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママごめんよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/27/4636896/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凛々しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返す。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、「制服のマネキン」はどうやって略したらいいの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、制服マネキン。さあどこが略されたでしょうか。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、 ブログでしかかかわってないけど応援してる気持ち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つたわってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、コメント見ればこの人がどれだけあみを応援してくれてるかわかるのさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから伝わってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 、 あみあみブログ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一年、経つんやん！スゴイ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃぁー質問！あみあみブログを振り返って\"どぉ？\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、多分昔に比べたら一段とあみらしさが出るようになったと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょうもないことしか書いてないけど、それでもたくさんの人に愛されるブログになればいいなと思ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、あみあみは嫌いな食べ物とかありますか？好き嫌いしない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、嫌いな食べ物はレバー！！それ以外はなんでも食べれるだよ  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、  天才日村勇紀のいいところベスト5お願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、髪型がいつもきまってるとこ。すごく笑ってくださるところ。歯並びがいいところ。設楽さんのどんなムチャぶりにしっかり応えてるところ。気さくなところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...どうじゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  、スタバで飛鳥の飲み物を能條さんひっくり返しちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄い焦りようだったらしいけども、どれくらいのレベルで焦ってたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、背中にイボが出来るんじゃないかレベル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、  中３の男子です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近いうちに期末テストがあるんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいいアドバイスください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、人生のうちにこんだけ勉強するのなんて今のうちだけなんだから今のうちに目一杯勉強頑張って！テストもいい緊張感で望むこと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばれっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、最近寝るときすっごい寒いんだけどなんか暖かくて早く眠れる方法ってないかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしえて!あみ先生(*｀・ω・´*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、お風呂から出たらそっこう暖かいパジャマに着替えて、体が冷えないうちにそっこう眠るっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが一番(⊙◞౪◟⊙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  、39歳のオッサンでも、あみちゃんの事、愛し続けてもいいですか？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、もぉちろんっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっくさん愛してください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  、あみおみが可愛すぎて頭から離れないんだけどどうすればいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでじゃー。なんでそんな可愛いんじゃー。なんでじゃー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A、能條を可愛いだなんてそんな嬉し過ぎて今なら空も飛べる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様に愛されてるからでございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次質問返しで返しきれてない質問答えてくよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/27/4636896/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}